eates a HttpRequestMessage object which is used to make a request to a downstream service. The middleware that makes the request is the last thing in the Ocelot pipeline. It does not call the next middleware. The response from the downstream service is stored in a per request scoped repository and retrived as the requests goes back up the Ocelot pipeline. There is a piece of middleware that maps the HttpResponseMessage onto the HttpResponse object and that is returned to the client. That is basically it with a bunch of other features.","iconUrl":"","id":"Ocelot","language":"","licenseExpression":"","licenseUrl":"","listed":false,"minClientVersion":"","packageContent":"https://api.nuget.org/v3-flatcontainer/ocelot/1.4.1/ocelot.1.4.1.nupkg","projectUrl":"https://github.com/TomPallister/Ocelot","published":"1900-01-01T00:00:00+00:00","requireLicenseAcceptance":false,"summary":"API Gateway created using .NET core.","tags":["API","Gateway",".NET","core"],"title":"Ocelot","version":"1.4.1"},"packageContent":"https://api.nuget.org/v3-flatcontainer/ocelot/1.4.1/ocelot.1.4.1.nupkg","registration":"https://api.nuget.org/v3/registration5-gz-semver2/ocelot/index.json"},{"@id":"https://api.nuget.org/v3/registration5-gz-semver2/ocelot/1.4.2.json","@type":"Package","commitId":"06d2d98c-cb20-4419-969c-2dbd0353386b","commitTimeStamp":"2024-06-13T08:47:07.8541379+00:00","catalogEntry":{"@id":"https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2024.06.13.08.46.29/ocelot.1.4.2.json","@type":"PackageDetails","authors":"Tom Pallister","dependencyGroups":[{"@id":"https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2024.06.13.08.46.29/ocelot.1.4.2.json#dependencygroup/.netcoreapp1.1","@type":"PackageDependencyGroup","dependencies":[{"@id":"https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2024.06.13.08.46.29/ocelot.1.4.2.json#dependencygroup/.netcoreapp1.1/microsoft.netcore.app","@type":"PackageDependency","id":"Microsoft.NETCore.App","range":"[1.1.1, )","registration":"https://api.nuget.org/v3/registration5-gz-semver2/micro